    <node id="&quot;ARMENIAN HERITAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Armenian heritage is reflected in Rafayel Shishmanyan's paintings, which are infused with vibrant colors and textures."&lt;SEP&gt;"Armenian heritage refers to the cultural background that influences Rafayel's artistic style, characterized by vibrant colors and textures."</data>
